  "final_message": "`shipping.ZONES` defines 5 zone codes: `NA-EAST`, `NA-WEST`, `EU-CENTRAL`, `EU-NORTH` and `APAC-SE`. I read every file in the directory.\n\nNone of the other files add to the count:\n- **`decoy_legacy_zones.py`**: an old table with `ZONE-A` to `ZONE-D`, marked as kept for reference only.\n- **`decoy_partner_regions.py`**: a partner carrier's region names, not zone codes.\n- **`decoy_warehouse_map.py`**: its values repeat three of the real codes, but it's a separate lookup table.\n- **`checkout.py`** and **`notify.py`**: they don't define any zones.\n\nANSWER: 5",
